  "//lint:dup": "1.2, LOWERED from 1.7 on 2026-08-26 after the raised-surface tokens were folded: eleven stylesheets declared the same three --surface-contrast values, nine of them with the same explanatory comment copied word for word, and they now read one [data-raised] rule in utilities.css. 67 clones/1.36% became 58/1.10%, and the visual baselines did not move a pixel, which is the proof it was a copy and not a difference. Before that: 1.7, raised from 1.5 on 2026-08-21 when the showcase screens moved to apps/showcase - the same 51 clones over ~3100 fewer lines read as 1.56% instead of 1.44%; the absolute number did not move, the denominator did. Lower it again when the clones are folded, never raise it to clear red."
